<section class="page-hero"><div class="container narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Your information</p><h1>Privacy & contact information.</h1><p class="lead">How we use the information you choose to share on this website.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container narrow privacy-copy"><h2>Audit requests and enquiries</h2><p>We use the name, email address, website and other details you submit to review and respond to your request. Providing an optional WhatsApp number lets us respond through that channel. Sending an enquiry does not subscribe you to marketing emails.</p><h2>Newsletter</h2><p>Subscribing separately asks us to send marketing insights to the email address you provide. You can ask to stop receiving them by contacting us on WhatsApp.</p><h2>Services used by the website</h2><p>The website is hosted on Netlify, which processes form submissions. Its hosting and form services may process technical request information and submitted details. We do not ask for account passwords or analytics credentials through these forms.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Opening WhatsApp takes you to a service operated by Meta. The contact page embeds Google Maps. Those services process information under their own privacy policies when you use them.</p><h2>Questions or removal requests</h2><p>To ask about information you have submitted, request a correction or ask for removal, <a href="{{ site.whatsapp }}" data-whatsapp target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">contact AldaHub on WhatsApp</a>. Please identify the request without sending passwords or other sensitive account details.</p></div></section>
